values ('40415a8d-bb27-f3a4-37c7-c19749a349d2', 'the-business-of-community-101', 'The Business of Community 101', 'A free four-week course that teaches you to run your community like it''s going to last, built on one question: how many people came back?', 'Frequency. Not the sound kind. The how-often kind. The question that decides whether a community lives isn''t how many people came. It''s how many came back.

Four weeks: The Engine, The Container, The Gathering, The Exchange. Each week is five short lessons, about an hour, and ends with one commitment you say out loud. By the end you know what a gathering costs you, what you charge, who came back, and who to text next week.

Free, by Daniel Tyack. It works on a spreadsheet and a phone. The build steps happen inside a Space.', '78d47bae-c4c8-4d1c-80a0-ac69aaf98ef8', (select id from spaces where slug = 'hq'), 'public', 'approved', now(), 'Creator Lab', 'standard', array['creator lab', 'hosting', 'community business', 'pricing', 'gatherings', 'leadership', 'return frequency']::text[], 10, null, '{"format":"online","schedule":"Self-paced","timezone":"America/Los_Angeles","location":null,"link":null,"notes":null,"eventId":null,"gathering":null}'::jsonb, false, 0, true, '/brand/frequency/photos/gathering-03.jpg', true)
